  "description": "Variation of condition 1 (Approved Plans) of planning permission reference 19/4221/FUL dated 04/08/20 for 'Demolition of existing building and erection of new five storey building to provide flexible use class A1 / A2 / A3 floor space at ground floor level and 8no self contained flats above with associated, bike store, amenity space, refuse/recycling storage.' Variation to include: Ground floor level, addition of plant room, introduction of a door to segregate the bin and cycle storage, addition of a vertical riser throughout the building, decrease in commercial floorspace, from 283sqm to 177sqm; Changes to the residential entrance; Insertion of 1no. additional rooflight at first floor level; Changes to second and third floor windows to front elevation; Relocation of 1no. fourth floor window on the south elevation; Amendments to the roof profile; Changes to fourth floor internal layouts; Inclusion of glazed parapets on drawings",
